# An organization is a group of people who use the app together: what
# they make in it belongs to the organization, and they work on it
# together.
#
# People belong to an organization by the part they play in it: members
# look, editors also change things, and administrators also decide who
# belongs. Whoever signs up founds an organization and runs
# it. A person may belong to several organizations and works in one at a
# time; what they see and create belongs to that one.
module Accounts::Organizations
end
